{'symbol': 'CSCO', 'date': '2021-10-12 11:30:00', 'title': 'CISCO LAUDED BY FROST & SULLIVAN FOR SUPPORTING INDUSTRIAL IOT DEPLOYMENTS WITH ITS LEADING PORTFOLIO OF SECURE AND SCALABLE SOLUTIONS', 'text': "CISCO'S VAST EXPERTISE AND ROBUST CUSTOMER RELATIONS POSITION IT AS A LEADING IIOT SOLUTIONS PROVIDER ENABLING TECHNOLOGY LEADERSHIP AND INNOVATION FOR BOTH IT AND OT DEPARTMENTS SANTA CLARA, CALIF., OCT. 12, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BASED ON ITS RECENT ANALYSIS OF THE GLOBAL INDUSTRIAL INTERNET OF THINGS (IIOT) MARKET,\xa0FROST & SULLIVAN RECOGNIZES CISCO SYSTEMS WITH THE 2020 GLOBAL ENABLING TECHNOLOGY LEADERSHIP AWARD."}